        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naŋ Yir-mɛ-yaa kä I-jëp",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Yir-mɛ-yaa naath diaal ti̱ti̱ thuk kɛ lät ruaacni Kuɔth Nhial ni Kuothdiɛn, kɛ tin ci Kuoth Nhial ni Kuɔthdiɛn kɛ jäk kä Yir-mɛ-yaa kɛ kɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu Ä-dhar-yaa gat Ɣo-ca-yaa kɛnɛ Yo-ɣa-nan gat Ka-re-ɛ̈k kɛ wutni diaal tin la ji̱ liakä Yir-mɛ-yaa jiök i̱, “Ji̱n latdi ni kac. Kuoth Nhial ni Kuothda /kenɛ ji̱ ja̱k kɛ ɣöö biɛ lar i̱, ‘/Cuarɛ wä kä I-jëp a bia wä cieŋ thi̱n’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö, Ba-ruk gat Ne-ri-yaa ɛ jɛn cär ji̱ ruac ɔ kɛ kui̱da ɛn ɣöö bakɔ la̱th tetni ji̱ Kɛ̈l-da-ya kɛ ɣöö bakɔ cu näk kiɛ bakɔ naŋ pecä kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ cu Yo-ɣa-nan gat Ka-re-ɛ̈k kɛnɛ bööth rɛmni diaal kɛ naath diaal luth ruac Kuɔth Nhial lo̱k kɛ ɣöö dee kɛ cieŋ muun kä Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö, cu Yo-ɣa-nan gat Ka-re-ɛ̈k kɛnɛ bööth rɛmni diaal nɛy diaal tëë ci kään kä Juda, kɛnɛ tëë luny jɔk röli diaal tëë ca kɛ kiɛth thi̱n tëë cieŋ muun Juda ben naŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wutni, män, kɛ gaat kɛ ruëëc kɛ nɛy diaal tëë ci Nɛ-bu-dhar-dan bo̱o̱th ga̱a̱ŋni kɛ ba̱ny Gɛ-dɛ̈l-yaa gat Ä-ɣi-kam gat Ca-pan mäni gök ni Yir-mɛ-yaa kɛnɛ Ba-ruk gat Ne-ri-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛ ben muun I-jëp, kɛ ɣöö /ken kɛ jɔw Kuɔth Nhial luɔ̱th. Kä cu kɛ cop kä Ta-pa-neth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruac Yir-mɛ-yaa kɛ kui̱ däkä I-jëp",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu riet Kuɔth Nhial ben kä Yir-mɛ-yaa kä Ta-pa-neth wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naŋ pääm ti di̱t kɛ tetku kä läthnikɛ dhar muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɔ̱kä in te thok rɛ̈ɛ̈k dhɔaar Pɛro min te kä Ta-pa-neth ni nhiam ji̱ Juda diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä läri jɛ kɛ i̱, ‘Ɣän Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ni Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl laar jɛ mɔ ɛn ɣöö ɣän bä ja̱ŋdä ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ja̱k, kä bɛ kuäärɛ ben la̱t ɛn guäth ɛ cä pääm ti̱ti̱ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ thi̱n ɛ, kä bɛ cua̱ rueecdiɛn kɛ buɔ̱m. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn bɛ mun I-jëp ben mak,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
